[{"title":"余在北门时每立春必前索宫中春词十馀解今逢兹日块坐州阁追怀旧题续作六章 其六","author":"宋祁","text":"楼角红阳上翠旗，钗头新燕一双飞。\n天将美景催行乐，剪尽春云作舞衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46585,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余在北门时每立春必前索宫中春词十馀解今逢兹日块坐州阁追怀旧题续作六章 其五","author":"宋祁","text":"故岁犹长新岁晚，东君破腊便回春。\n花枝稍稍暗红上，已觉轻寒不著人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46586,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余在北门时每立春必前索宫中春词十馀解今逢兹日块坐州阁追怀旧题续作六章 其四","author":"宋祁","text":"汉宫节物重年华，宝胜迎春绰绰斜。\n不待东风吹煦力，剪刀催出上林花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46587,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余在北门时每立春必前索宫中春词十馀解今逢兹日块坐州阁追怀旧题续作六章 其三","author":"宋祁","text":"星杓夜压禁城东，葭縠晨飞玉管中。\n扑扑烟花千户暖，嘈嘈歌吹九门风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46588,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余在北门时每立春必前索宫中春词十馀解今逢兹日块坐州阁追怀旧题续作六章 其二","author":"宋祁","text":"清晓东郊转翠舆，苍龙驱暖入储胥。\n便回天上阳和气，散作人间宽大书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46589,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余在北门时每立春必前索宫中春词十馀解今逢兹日块坐州阁追怀旧题续作六章 其一","author":"宋祁","text":"漠漠春从天际来，春旂已在望春台。\n寒销岭上容梅落，暖拂江南放雁回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46590,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余将北征先送同解","author":"宋祁","text":"动地箕风白草乾，旗亭歌阕据征鞍。\n三冬大雪梁台路，不敢逢君唱苦寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46591,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事","author":"宋祁","text":"我来春已晏，道樾半清阴。\n崖暗石蹲虎，林明花散金。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46592,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呈成上人","author":"宋祁","text":"佛国天花两送春，岁阴何意重相亲。\n劳师且置弥天论，凿齿今才敌半人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46593,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拟西出阳关无故人","author":"宋祁","text":"雨中柳色醉中迷，上马弯弓散马蹄。\n阳关门外故人远，独有残阳相伴西。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46594,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李树","author":"宋祁","text":"曾见繁英出缥墙，更将朱实奉华堂。\n蹊桃得地偏相映，莫损清阴欲代僵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46595,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李德林","author":"宋祁","text":"内史兵机是所长，东师飞度取降王。\n谁知一夕谗言入，不得文皇七宝装。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46596,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杨柳词四解 其三","author":"宋祁","text":"苑路黄黄隔翠霏，三眠初熟倚春晖。\n枝枝柔曼皆堪爱，不分羌人拗折归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46597,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杨柳词四解 其四","author":"宋祁","text":"玉树森森拂晓空，子云辛苦赋青葱。\n不知苒弱当君意，却就长杨便作宫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46598,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杨柳词四解 其一","author":"宋祁","text":"垂杨无态不堪誇，犹有馀情解作花。\n三月纷纷飞似雪，白门啼杀叛儿鸦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46599,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杨柳词四解 其二","author":"宋祁","text":"天幕风和毕雨馀，翠轻黄浅亚春衢。\n不知张绪当年日，似得长条濯濯无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46600,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"汴堤閒望","author":"宋祁","text":"虹度长桥箭激流，夹堤春树翠阴稠。\n谁知昼夜滔滔意，不是沉舟即载舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46601,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泛涡水二首 其二","author":"宋祁","text":"漠漠新茸上渚蒲，日痕波态共涵虚。\n无人解作江南曲，荷底田田自戏鱼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46602,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泛涡水二首 其一","author":"宋祁","text":"川上轻风正满旗，幽寻不惮进舟迟。\n兰桡过后汀烟合，却见惊鸥自下时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46603,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芦 其一","author":"宋祁","text":"袅娜脩茎青玉攒，凫翁濯罢翠痕乾。\n湘君直寄江湖乐，要作风汀雨濑看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46604,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芦 其二","author":"宋祁","text":"我惭散质山中养，君结孤根江上来。\n相对中园两无用，菰芦何处有奇才。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46605,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芦 其三","author":"宋祁","text":"溪芦得种庭轩下，翠色虽新野色销。\n要待九秋风雨后，冷梢危叶作萧萧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46606,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诏复制科有谓予应诏者","author":"宋祁","text":"汉幄思贤尺诏飞，不材充赋谅非宜。\n就令能奏三千牍，未免长安欲死饥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46607,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"邻郡移书覆狱","author":"宋祁","text":"堀堁征尘敝客裾，晓盘贪饭鲁人蔬。\n多年养病先黄老，岂辨司空城旦书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46608,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闰九月晦日登舟二首 其二","author":"宋祁","text":"二山皆在眼，未忍去淮津。\n三宿宁无恋，况非桑下人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46609,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闰九月晦日登舟二首 其一","author":"宋祁","text":"淮平舟未进，远绪怅依依。\n勿谓王孙怨，先如春草归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46610,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鸡答","author":"宋祁","text":"君园稻富非争食，省树枝深未许栖。\n但得齐蝇无乱响，不辞风雨五更啼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46611,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和人禁中作","author":"宋祁","text":"前殿笼童昼鼓赊，对论兵食近袍纱。\n此时刻意言颇牧，不为云中首级差。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46612,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和三司尚书宣德门侍观灯","author":"宋祁","text":"觚棱南抱綵山连，楼下沈香百炬然。\n此夜有人之帝所，默裁馀韵记钧天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46613,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和三司尚书清明","author":"宋祁","text":"阳岑晚树飘花外，冷落晨杯捣杏馀。\n喉舌官崇无晤赏，一轩筠粉伴刊书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46614,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和三司晏尚书秋咏 其二","author":"宋祁","text":"溪漘水净莲茎倒，林杪风乾栗罅开。\n迥眺独吟俄夕景，毕逋鸦尾过墙来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46615,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和三司晏尚书秋咏 其一","author":"宋祁","text":"霜繁天白雁行单，灌莽梢梢矗早寒。\n正是河山摇落处，莫轻离思欲凭栏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46616,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和三司晏尚书漫成","author":"宋祁","text":"日烈花休树结阴，红牙贪调万黄金。\n伯松不学陈遵饮，为识鸱夷是酒箴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46617,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和中丞晏尚书忆谯涡二首 其二","author":"宋祁","text":"春波漫处寻他浦，晚潦清时觅故洲。\n使舸忽归心赏罢，后来风浪但惊鸥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46618,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和中丞晏尚书忆谯涡二首 其一","author":"宋祁","text":"幰幰行舻破练光，提鞭旧岸接回塘。\n使君几作临波醉，犹省当时问葛彊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46619,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和天休龙图经句署怀旧忆道卿舍人并见寄 其二","author":"宋祁","text":"讽书小史非新至，比舍名郎半昔游。\n君算青云多少地，三年来作北平侯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":46620,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和天休龙图经句署怀旧忆道卿舍人并见寄 其一","author":"宋祁","text":"帝梧春早二鸾飞，羁羽孤翻得树迟。\n今日并巢阿阁畔，依然同识旧栖枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv